-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ח/3: הסכם שכר קיבוצי עם ארגון המורים בחטיבות העליונות
-- The wage agreement of 14.3.2018 for upper-division teaching employees,
-- as the circular sets it out: it amends the components-merger agreement of
-- 5.9.2017 separately for teachers in the Oz LeTmura reform and for those
-- outside it and principals, raises the counsellor's and new role
-- stipends, adds a mentor stipend, a training-unit cap and a one-time
-- grant, and orders make-up school days for the 2017 strike.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in salary months from September
-- 2017 (= 1): March 2018 is 7, April 8, May 9, August 12, October 2018 14.

§ `חוזר תשע"ח/3 הסכם שכר בחטיבות העליונות`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, subject, and the recital that the agreement was signed on 14.3.2018; no rule.

-- §1: the agreement governs from 1.9.2017 to 28.2.2022 and amends the
-- components-merger agreement of 5.9.2017 (circular תשע"ח/1).
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement governs on` `the day` IF
    `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017 AND `the day` AT MOST Date 28 2 2022

§§ `2–3 תחולה והגדרות`

@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2 akn:art_3/p3 akn:art_3/p5 akn:art_3/p6
DECLARE `employee category` IS ONE OF
    `a teacher in the reform`
    `a teacher not in the reform`
    `a principal in the reform`
    `a principal not in the reform`

@desc An upper-division teaching employee, as far as this circular asks about her.
DECLARE `employee` HAS
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether or not employed under the reform's terms
    `category` IS AN `employee category`

@ref akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement applies to` e IF
    e's `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011`

-- "מנהלים": principals in the reform and outside it.
@ref akn:art_3/p4
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a principal` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a principal in the reform`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a principal not in the reform` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- The two groups the agreement treats apart: teachers in the reform, and
-- teachers outside it together with all principals.
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is outside the reform or a principal` c IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a teacher in the reform` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `4 תוספת שכר — טבלאות השכר המשולב`

-- §4.1-§4.2, for teachers in the reform: the combined-salary tables rise
-- 18.212% from 1.9.2017 (annex A), are updated for seniority 1-7 from
-- 1.9.2018 (annex B), and rise a further 1.2% from 1.12.2018 (annex C).
-- The annexes are not in the corpus: the table in force is named here, and
-- its figures are an input.
DECLARE `combined-salary table` IS ONE OF
    `the tables before this agreement`
    `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
    `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
    `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
    `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`

@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_4-2
`the reform update of 1.9.2017` MEANS 0.18212
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_3
`the reform update of 1.12.2018` MEANS 0.012

-- Annex B updates seniority 1 to 7 only; above 7 the annex-A table is
-- read as continuing until 1.12.2018.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-1 akn:art_4__para_4-1/p2 akn:art_4__para_4-1__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_4-2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the reform table in force` `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
    THEN `annex C, reform, from 1.12.2018`
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 AND `seniority` AT MOST 7
         THEN `annex B, reform, from 1.9.2018`
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN `annex A, reform, from 1.9.2017`
              ELSE `the tables before this agreement`

-- §4.3-§4.5, for teachers outside the reform and principals: no 18.212%
-- update (the one made under the merger agreement is cancelled back to
-- 1.9.2017, §4.5); from 1.9.2018 seniority 1-7 is updated by annex D.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-3 akn:art_4__para_4-4 akn:art_4__para_4-5
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the table in force outside the reform` `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018 AND `seniority` AT MOST 7
    THEN `annex D, outside the reform and principals, from 1.9.2018`
    ELSE `the tables before this agreement`

GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE, `seniority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `combined-salary table`
DECIDE `the table in force for` e `the day` `seniority` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN `the table in force outside the reform` `the day` `seniority`
    ELSE `the reform table in force` `the day` `seniority`

§§ `5 תוספת שקלית 2016`

@desc A period of the updated 2016 shekel supplement and its amount for a full position.
DECLARE `shekel period` HAS
    `period from`          IS A DATE
    `period to`            IS A DATE @desc 31.12.9999 stands for "ואילך"
    `full-position amount` IS A NUMBER

-- §5a, for teachers in the reform (replacing section 4 of the merger agreement).
@ref akn:art_5__para_a
`the reform shekel supplement` MEANS
    LIST `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2017)  (Date 31 12 2017) 601,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2018)  (Date 31 5 2018)  832.62,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 6 2018)  (Date 30 11 2018) 963.11,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 12 2018) (Date 31 12 2018) 1022.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2019)  (Date 31 8 2019)  1122.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2019)  (Date 31 12 2019) 1142.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2020)  (Date 31 8 2020)  1222.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2020)  (Date 31 12 2020) 1262.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2021)  (Date 31 8 2021)  1342.40,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2021)  (Date 31 12 9999) 1382.40

-- §5b's second paragraph, for teachers outside the reform and principals
-- (the corpus nests it under §5a's (ב)).
@ref akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b/p2 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b/p3 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_3 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_4 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_5 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_6 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_7 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_8 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_9 akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_10
`the shekel supplement outside the reform` MEANS
    LIST `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2017)  (Date 31 12 2017) 387.57,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2018)  (Date 31 5 2018)  619.19,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 6 2018)  (Date 30 11 2018) 749.68,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 12 2018) (Date 31 12 2018) 808.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2019)  (Date 31 8 2019)  908.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2019)  (Date 31 12 2019) 928.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2020)  (Date 31 8 2020)  1008.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2020)  (Date 31 12 2020) 1048.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 1 2021)  (Date 31 8 2021)  1128.97,
         `shekel period` (Date 1 9 2021)  (Date 31 12 9999) 1168.97

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `shekel period`
      `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the amount on` ps `the day` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `full-position amount`)
             (filter (GIVEN p YIELD `the day` AT LEAST p's `period from` AND `the day` AT MOST p's `period to`) ps))

-- The rest of the supplement's rules — sections 4(c)-(h) of the agreement
-- of 23.3.2017, part-position pro-rating among them — are unchanged for
-- both groups (§5b and its repetition) and are not encoded here.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_10__pnt_b
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the updated shekel supplement 2016 for a full position` e `the day` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN `the amount on` `the shekel supplement outside the reform` `the day`
    ELSE `the amount on` `the reform shekel supplement` `the day`

-- §5b(c) (nested in the corpus under (10)): the supplement paid to those
-- outside the reform and principals under the merger agreement's former
-- section 4 is cancelled back to 1.9.2017; this schedule replaces it.
@ref akn:art_5__para_b__subpara_b__cls_10__pnt_c
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the former merger-agreement shekel supplement stands for` e IF
    NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `shekel period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the periods follow one another` ps IF
    all (GIVEN pair YIELD `Day` (pair's snd's `period from`) EQUALS `Day` (pair's fst's `period to`) PLUS 1)
        (zip (take (count ps MINUS 1) ps) (drop 1 ps))

#ASSERT `the periods follow one another` `the reform shekel supplement`
#ASSERT `the periods follow one another` `the shekel supplement outside the reform`

§§ `6 תוספת מיזוג רכיבים`

-- §6 adds section 5A to the merger agreement: from 1.9.2017 those outside
-- the reform and principals get the merger supplement, a uniform 18.951%
-- of the combined salary alone, raised from 1.12.2018 to 20.378%.
@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the merger supplement rate` e `the day` IS
    IF NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
         THEN 0.20378
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN 0.18951
              ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the merger supplement` e `the day` `combined salary` IS
    `the merger supplement rate` e `the day` TIMES `combined salary`

-- §6 (5A(d)-(e)): what the merger supplement counts for, and what not.
DECLARE `purpose` IS ONE OF
    `percentage supplements computed on the combined salary`
    `the hourly value for substitution hours`
    `salary reduction for absence`
    `severance pay`
    `pension provident deposits under section 46 of Oz LeTmura`
    `the study fund and the Dafna fund`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`
    `salary for any matter`
    `the combined-salary base`

@ref akn:art_6/p1
GIVEN u IS A `purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the merger supplement counts for` u IF
    CONSIDER u
    WHEN `topping up to the minimum wage` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `salary for any matter` THEN FALSE
    WHEN `the combined-salary base` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- 20.378% is 18.951% with the whole salary raised 1.2%: (1.18951 × 1.012) − 1.
#ASSERT TRUNC ((1.18951 TIMES 1.012 MINUS 1) TIMES 100 PLUS 0.0005) 3 EQUALS 20.378

§§ `7 ביטול התוספות המאוחדות למורים שאינם ברפורמה ולמנהלים`

@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p2
DECLARE `merged supplement` IS ONE OF
    `the 87 supplement`
    `the 2001 supplement`
    `the 2008 supplement`
    `the 2011 supplement`
    `the 2011 erosion supplement`
    `the 2016 percentage supplement`

-- §7 (new section 6(a)-(c) of the merger agreement): from 1.9.2017 those
-- outside the reform and principals are no longer paid the six merged
-- supplements, which are no longer a base for others. The '94 supplement
-- is not among them (§10).
@ref akn:art_7/p2
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, s IS A `merged supplement`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is paid the merged supplement` e s `the day` IF
    `the day` LESS THAN Date 1 9 2017

§§ `8 מנהלים ברפורמה`

-- §8.1: for principals in the reform, the transition-to-reform supplement
-- (section 24 of Oz LeTmura) is computed from 1.9.2017 on the combined
-- salary, the '94 supplement and the merger supplement only.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-1 akn:art_8__para_8-1/p2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `the 94 supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the merger supplement amount` IS A NUMBER
      `the other supplements` IS A NUMBER @desc the 2001, 2008, 2011 and 2011-erosion supplements it was computed on before
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the transition-to-reform supplement` `the day` `combined salary` `the 94 supplement` `the merger supplement amount` `the other supplements` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
    THEN `combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the merger supplement amount`
    ELSE `combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the other supplements`

-- §8.2: the "87 transition-to-reform" supplement stands at 88.52 on
-- signature and moves only by section 4(d) of the agreement of 23.3.17.
@ref akn:art_8__para_8-2 akn:art_8__para_8-2/p2
GIVEN `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17` IS A NUMBER @desc the cumulative update that mechanism gives, as a fraction; set elsewhere
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement on signature, updated` `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17` IS
    88.52 TIMES (1 PLUS `update under section 4(d) of 23.3.17`)

§§ `9 ביטול הוראות בסעיף 6 להסכם מיזוג רכיבים`

-- §9: section 6(c)'s tail from "כך למשל" and section 6(d) of the merger
-- agreement are repealed for teachers in the reform and outside it.
DECLARE `merger-agreement provision` IS ONE OF
    `section 6(c) tail from "for example"`
    `section 6(d)`
    `another provision`

@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b
GIVEN p IS A `merger-agreement provision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is repealed for teachers by section 9` p IF
    CONSIDER p
    WHEN `another provision` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

§§ `10 תוספת '94 למורים שאינם ברפורמה ומנהלים`

-- §10.1: the cancellation of the '94 supplement under the merger agreement
-- is itself cancelled back to 1.9.2017; §10.2-§10.3 set its amount.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 94 supplement outside the reform` e `the day` IS
    IF NOT `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 12 2018
         THEN 164.51
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2017
              THEN 162.56
              ELSE 0

§§ `11 ביצוע למפרע`

DECLARE `provision of this agreement` IS ONE OF
    `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`

-- §11.1-§11.2: the listed provisions are one arrangement, carried out
-- together or not at all.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-1 akn:art_11__para_11-1/p2 akn:art_11__para_11-2
GIVEN `provisions implemented` IS A LIST OF `provision of this agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the implementation is lawful` `provisions implemented` IF
        count `provisions implemented` EQUALS 0
    OR  all (GIVEN p YIELD elem p `provisions implemented`)
            (LIST `4.3`, `4.5`, `5.2`, `5.3`, `6`, `7`, `10.1`, `10.2`)

-- §11.3: those outside the reform and principals keep any excess the
-- former merger agreement paid them for 1.9.2017-31.1.2018.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`
      `gross due under the former merger agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc for 1.9.2017 to 31.1.2018
      `gross due under this agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc for the same period
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `excess to be repaid` e `gross due under the former merger agreement` `gross due under this agreement` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN 0
    ELSE max 0 (`gross due under the former merger agreement` MINUS `gross due under this agreement`)

DECLARE `wage action` IS ONE OF
    `implement the agreement in the salary` HAS `arrears since 1.9.2017 paid` IS A NUMBER
    `deduct an overpayment` HAS `deducted` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the one-time grant` HAS `grant paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay for make-up lessons` HAS `make-up pay` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the advance` HAS `advance paid` IS A NUMBER
    `issue implementation guidelines to principals`

-- §11.4: from the April 2018 salary (8), no later than the May 2018 salary
-- (9), with the differences since 1.9.2017.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-4
GIVEN `arrears owed` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `carrying out the agreement` `arrears owed` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `implement the agreement in the salary` `paid`
          PROVIDED `paid` AT LEAST `arrears owed`
    WITHIN 9
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 11.4: no later than the salary for May 2018, with the differences since 1.9.2017"

-- §11.5: up to the August 2018 salary (12), an overpayment by an error in
-- implementing the agreement is an advance on wages (Wage Protection Law
-- 1958, section 25(a)(7)).
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-5
GIVEN `salary month` IS A NUMBER, `overpaid by an implementation error` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the overpayment counts as an advance on wages` `salary month` `overpaid by an implementation error` IF
    `overpaid by an implementation error` AND `salary month` AT MOST 12

-- §11.6: written notice 30 days before the deduction (days from the
-- notice), then deduction in twelve equal monthly parts.
@ref akn:art_11__para_11-6
GIVEN `overpayment` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `deducting an overpayment after notice` `overpayment` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `deduct an overpayment` `any amount`
    WITHIN 30
    HENCE (PARTY `the employer`
           MAY `deduct an overpayment` `amount`
               PROVIDED `amount` AT MOST `overpayment` DIVIDED BY 12)
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 11.6: written notice 30 days before the deduction begins"

-- akn:art_11__para_11-7 akn:art_11__para_11-7/p2 The union's statement that the section admits no error in any salary; no rule.

§§ `12 ביצוע לגבי מורים ברפורמה`

-- §12: for teachers in the reform the changes create no retroactive
-- liability, and what was paid under the merger agreement is not paid twice.
@ref akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `owed under this agreement for past months` IS A NUMBER, `already paid under the merger agreement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `retroactive payment due` e `owed under this agreement for past months` `already paid under the merger agreement` IS
    IF `is outside the reform or a principal` (e's `category`)
    THEN max 0 (`owed under this agreement for past months` MINUS `already paid under the merger agreement`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `13 גמול יועץ חינוכי`

@desc A printed row of the counsellor's stipend table: years of counselling and the rate, in percent, at signature, from 1.1.2020 and from 1.1.2021.
DECLARE `counsellor row` HAS
    `counselling years from` IS A NUMBER @desc 5 stands for "5 ומעלה"
    `rate at signature`      IS A NUMBER
    `rate from 1.1.2020`     IS A NUMBER
    `rate from 1.1.2021`     IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-1/t1
`the counsellor's stipend table` MEANS
    LIST `counsellor row` 1 5 6   6.5,
         `counsellor row` 2 6 7   8,
         `counsellor row` 3 7 8.5 9.5,
         `counsellor row` 4 8 10  10.5,
         `counsellor row` 5 9 11  12

-- §13.2: the stipend's other rules (section 17(a) of Oz LeTmura) are
-- unchanged; its base among them is an input.
@ref akn:art_13__para_13-1 akn:art_13__para_13-2
GIVEN `counselling years` IS A NUMBER, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the counsellor's stipend rate` `counselling years` `the day` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2021
                            THEN r's `rate from 1.1.2021` DIVIDED BY 100
                            ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 1 2020
                                 THEN r's `rate from 1.1.2020` DIVIDED BY 100
                                 ELSE r's `rate at signature` DIVIDED BY 100)
             (filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `counselling years from` EQUALS min `counselling years` 5)
                     `the counsellor's stipend table`))

§§ `14 גמולי תפקיד חדשים`

@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_1 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_3 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_4 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_5 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6
DECLARE `new role` IS ONE OF
    `trips coordinator`
    `pedagogical coordinator`
    `integration and special populations coordinator`
    `ICT coordinator`
    `matriculation coordinator`
    `discipline and school climate coordinator`

-- §14.1: from 1.9.2019 a teacher in the reform filling one of the new roles
-- earns a role stipend of 6% of the combined salary and the Oz LeTmura
-- supplement; §14.3: the subject coordinator's rules of calculation and
-- payment apply.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-1 akn:art_14__para_14-3
GIVEN e IS AN `employee`, `the day` IS A DATE
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the new role stipend` e `the day` `combined salary` `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS
    IF  e's `category` EQUALS `a teacher in the reform` AND `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
    THEN 0.06 TIMES (`combined salary` PLUS `Oz LeTmura supplement`)
    ELSE 0

-- The Ministry's note: how many of the new roles a principal may choose,
-- in addition to the upper division's existing roles.
@ref akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6/p2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6__cls_1 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6__cls_2 akn:art_14__para_14-2__subpara_6__cls_2/p2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `new roles a principal may choose` `the day` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2021
    THEN 3
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2020
         THEN 2
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
              THEN 1
              ELSE 0

§§ `15 גמול מורה חונך`

-- §15: from 1.9.2018 a mentor teacher earns 2.4% per intern, up to three
-- interns, on the base §15(1)-(2) set; §15.2: the subject coordinator's
-- rules apply. A principal has no base (F-2017-18_tashach_03-d).
@ref akn:art_15/p1 akn:art_15/p2 akn:art_15__para_15-2
`the mentor rate per intern` MEANS 0.024

@ref akn:art_15__para_1 akn:art_15__para_2
GIVEN c IS AN `employee category`
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `Oz LeTmura supplement` IS A NUMBER
      `the 94 supplement` IS A NUMBER, `the merger supplement amount` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor stipend base` c `combined salary` `Oz LeTmura supplement` `the 94 supplement` `the merger supplement amount` IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `a teacher in the reform`     THEN JUST (`combined salary` PLUS `Oz LeTmura supplement`)
    WHEN `a teacher not in the reform` THEN JUST (`combined salary` PLUS `the 94 supplement` PLUS `the merger supplement amount`)
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref akn:art_15/p1 akn:art_15/p2
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `interns` IS A NUMBER, `base` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the mentor stipend` `the day` `interns` `base` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
    THEN `the mentor rate per intern` TIMES min `interns` 3 TIMES `base`
    ELSE 0

§§ `16 גמול השתלמות`

-- §16 (new section 18(1)(2) of Oz LeTmura): from 1.9.2019 the cap of
-- training units is 19, beside double-degree units; the 19th unit counts
-- only courses starting no earlier than school year תשע"ט or the year the
-- teacher began under the reform, the later of them. Sections 18(d)-(h)(1)
-- apply to it too (not encoded here).
@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE, `units earned` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `training units recognised` `the day` `units earned` IS
    IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
    THEN min `units earned` 19
    ELSE `units earned`

@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN `course start` IS A DATE, `start of the teacher's first reform year` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a course may count towards the 19th unit` `course start` `start of the teacher's first reform year` IF
        `course start` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
    AND `course start` AT LEAST `start of the teacher's first reform year`

§§ `17 מענק חד פעמי`

@desc An employee's months in the grant period 1.9.2017-30.11.2017.
DECLARE `grant month` HAS
    `position fraction that month` IS A NUMBER  @desc the (weighted) position; for a month wholly in maternity, reserve or unpaid sick leave, the fraction on the eve of it (§17f)
    `kind of month` IS A `kind of grant month`

DECLARE `kind of grant month` IS ONE OF
    `worked`
    `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`
    `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`
    `not employed`

@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_a/p2
`the one-time grant` MEANS 1000

-- §17e-§17g: unpaid leave (sabbatical included, and leave treated as
-- unpaid, also after maternity leave ends) does not count; reserve duty,
-- maternity and parenthood leave and unpaid sick leave do.
@ref akn:art_17__para_e akn:art_17__para_e/p2 akn:art_17__para_g
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the month counts as work` m IF
    CONSIDER m's `kind of month`
    WHEN `worked` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- §17f: for those months the fraction is the one on the eve of the leave;
-- §17c, §17d, §17f: never above 100% in a month.
@ref akn:art_17__para_f akn:art_17__para_f/p2 akn:art_17__para_c/p2
GIVEN m IS A `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month's share` m IS
    IF `the month counts as work` m
    THEN min (m's `position fraction that month`) 1 DIVIDED BY 3
    ELSE 0

-- §17a-§17d: full grant for a full position all the period, else in
-- proportion to the period worked and the (weighted) position.
@ref akn:art_17__para_a akn:art_17__para_b akn:art_17__para_c akn:art_17__para_d
GIVEN `the three months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the one-time grant due` `the three months` IS
    `the one-time grant` TIMES sum (map `the month's share` `the three months`)

-- §17h-§17j: the grant is not salary, and what it is not counted for.
DECLARE `grant purpose` IS ONE OF
    `salary for any matter`
    `the hourly value for substitution hours`
    `salary reduction for an hour of absence`
    `severance pay`
    `provident deposits`
    `topping up to the minimum wage`
    `the combined-salary base`

@ref akn:art_17__para_h akn:art_17__para_i akn:art_17__para_j
GIVEN u IS A `grant purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the grant counts for` u IF FALSE

-- §17a: paid with the March 2018 salary (7), no later than April's (8).
@ref akn:art_17__para_a/p3
GIVEN `the three months` IS A LIST OF `grant month`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `paying the one-time grant` `the three months` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the one-time grant` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `the one-time grant due` `the three months`
    WITHIN 8
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 17a: no later than the salary for April 2018"

§§ `18 שכר המנהלים`

-- §18a: the parties go on negotiating how to allocate the budget agreed for
-- principals' pay. §18b: failing an agreement by 1.4.2018, the "87
-- transition" supplement rises by 460 from 1.9.2018 (to 548.52) and by
-- another 460 from 1.9.2019 (to 1,008.52).
@ref akn:art_18__para_a
GIVEN `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `negotiation on the allocation continues` `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018` IF
    NOT `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018`

@ref akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_18__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018` IS A BOOLEAN, `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 87 transition supplement under section 18b` `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018` `the day` IS
    IF `an allocation agreement signed by 1.4.2018`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2019
         THEN JUST 1008.52
         ELSE IF `the day` AT LEAST Date 1 9 2018
              THEN JUST 548.52
              ELSE NOTHING

-- akn:art_18__para_c A further circular will be published as needed; no rule.

§§ `19 החזר ימי לימודים בשל שביתה`

DECLARE `make-up day` IS ONE OF
    `the day after Shavuot, 21.5.2018`
    `Lag BaOmer, 3.5.2018`
    `the day after Sukkot, 2.10.2018`

@desc An upper division and one of its teaching employees, as far as the make-up days ask.
DECLARE `struck school and teacher` HAS
    `school struck on a general strike day`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc 12.11.2017 or 21.11.2017
    `local strike days at the school`        IS A NUMBER  @desc full days of strike after the general strike days, in November or December 2017
    `lessons missed on the day chosen for Shavuot` IS A NUMBER @desc on 12.11.2017 or 21.11.2017, as the principal chose, by the general strike
    `lessons missed on general strike days`  IS A NUMBER
    `lessons missed on local strike days`    IS A NUMBER
    `lessons made up after Shavuot`          IS A NUMBER
    `lessons made up on Lag BaOmer`          IS A NUMBER

-- §19.1: by the Director-General's notice of 14.3.2018 the Ministry orders
-- make-up school days in the upper divisions that struck.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a__cls_1 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_1 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_1 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_1/p2
GIVEN d IS A `make-up day`
      s IS A `struck school and teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the school holds` d s IF
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `the day after Shavuot, 21.5.2018` THEN s's `school struck on a general strike day`
    WHEN `Lag BaOmer, 3.5.2018` THEN s's `school struck on a general strike day` AND s's `local strike days at the school` AT LEAST 1
    WHEN `the day after Sukkot, 2.10.2018` THEN s's `school struck on a general strike day` OR s's `local strike days at the school` AT LEAST 1

-- §19.1(a)(2): the Shavuot timetable is that of 12.11.2017 or 21.11.2017,
-- as the principal decides — an input (`lessons missed on the day chosen
-- for Shavuot`). §19.1(a)(3): only those absent that day by the general
-- strike, for as many lessons as they missed, and no more.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a__cls_2 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a__cls_3
GIVEN s IS A `struck school and teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `lessons owed after Shavuot` s IS
    s's `lessons missed on the day chosen for Shavuot`

-- §19.1(b)(2)-(4): up to 8 frontal lessons on Lag BaOmer, only for those
-- absent on local strike days, no more than they missed there.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_2 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_3 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_4
GIVEN s IS A `struck school and teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `lessons owed on Lag BaOmer` s IS
    min (s's `lessons missed on local strike days`) 8

-- §19.1(c)(2)-(4): after Sukkot, up to 8 frontal lessons, for those whose
-- missed lessons exceed those made up, and no more than the difference.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_2 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_3 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_4
GIVEN s IS A `struck school and teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `lessons owed after Sukkot` s IS
    min (max 0 (s's `lessons missed on general strike days`
                PLUS s's `lessons missed on local strike days`
                MINUS s's `lessons made up after Shavuot`
                MINUS s's `lessons made up on Lag BaOmer`)) 8

-- §19.1(a)(4), (b)(5), (c)(5), (d)(2): each make-up lesson earns the pay
-- withheld for one strike hour; paid with the May 2018 salary (9) for
-- Shavuot and Lag BaOmer, with October 2018's (14) for Sukkot.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a__cls_4 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_5 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_5 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_c__cls_5/p2 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2
GIVEN `lessons made up` IS A NUMBER, `pay withheld for one strike hour` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `make-up pay` `lessons made up` `pay withheld for one strike hour` IS
    `lessons made up` TIMES `pay withheld for one strike hour`

@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_a__cls_4 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_b__cls_5
GIVEN `pay due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `paying for the spring make-up days` `pay due` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay for make-up lessons` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `pay due`
    WITHIN 9
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 19.1: make-up pay for Shavuot and Lag BaOmer with the salary for May 2018"

-- §19.1(d): teachers in a school with more than one local strike day, who
-- made up lessons on Lag BaOmer and still missed more than they made up,
-- may make up frontal and individual hours during תשע"ח as the principal
-- decides.
@ref akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_1 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p2 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p3 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p4 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p5 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p6 akn:art_19__para_1__subpara_d__cls_2/p7
GIVEN s IS A `struck school and teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may make up further hours in תשע"ח` s IF
        s's `local strike days at the school` GREATER THAN 1
    AND s's `school struck on a general strike day`
    AND s's `lessons made up on Lag BaOmer` GREATER THAN 0
    AND s's `lessons missed on local strike days` GREATER THAN s's `lessons made up on Lag BaOmer`

-- §19.2: an advance with the April 2018 salary (8): the general-strike
-- deduction, plus the deduction for the first local strike day.
@ref akn:art_19__para_2 akn:art_19__para_2/p2 akn:art_19__para_2__subpara_a akn:art_19__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN `struck on a general strike day` IS A BOOLEAN
      `general strike deduction` IS A NUMBER
      `struck on a local strike day` IS A BOOLEAN
      `first local strike day deduction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the strike advance` `struck on a general strike day` `general strike deduction` `struck on a local strike day` `first local strike day deduction` IS
    (IF `struck on a general strike day` THEN `general strike deduction` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `struck on a local strike day` THEN `first local strike day deduction` ELSE 0)

@ref akn:art_19__para_2/p2
GIVEN `advance due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `paying the strike advance` `advance due` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the advance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `advance due`
    WITHIN 8
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 19.2: the advance is paid with the salary for April 2018"

-- §19.2(c): the advance is recovered with the May 2018 salary (9) up to the
-- spring make-up pay, the rest with October 2018's (14); for one on unpaid
-- leave or sabbatical in תשע"ט, with May and August 2018 (12); on leaving,
-- from the last salary and any payment due.
@ref akn:art_19__para_2__subpara_c akn:art_19__para_2__subpara_c/p2 akn:art_19__para_2__subpara_c/p3
GIVEN `advance` IS A NUMBER, `spring make-up pay` IS A NUMBER, `on leave or sabbatical in תשע"ט` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `advance recovery`
DECIDE `recovering the strike advance` `advance` `spring make-up pay` `on leave or sabbatical in תשע"ט` IS
    LIST `advance recovery` 9 (min `advance` `spring make-up pay`),
         `advance recovery` (IF `on leave or sabbatical in תשע"ט` THEN 12 ELSE 14) (max 0 (`advance` MINUS `spring make-up pay`))

DECLARE `advance recovery` HAS
    `salary month of recovery` IS A NUMBER
    `amount recovered` IS A NUMBER

-- §19.3: the Ministry issues guidelines to principals (no date given).
@ref akn:art_19__para_3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `wage action`
DECIDE `the Ministry's guidelines` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `issue implementation guidelines to principals`

-- akn:art_19__para_3/p2 akn:art_19__para_3/p3 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_1 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_2 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_3 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_4 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_5 akn:art_19__para_3__subpara_6 The contact line and the list of enclosures (annexes A to E and the agreement); none of them is in the corpus.

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Findings.

-- F-2017-18_tashach_03-a: §18b allocates "the cost under subsections
-- (a)(1) and (a)(2) above"; §18a has no (1) or (2).
`the subparagraphs §18a has` MEANS 0
`the subparagraphs §18b cites in §18a` MEANS 2
`section 18b cites subparagraphs section 18a does not have` MEANS
    `the subparagraphs §18b cites in §18a` GREATER THAN `the subparagraphs §18a has`
#ASSERT `section 18b cites subparagraphs section 18a does not have`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_03-b: §11.1-§11.2 bind "sections 5.2 and 5.3"
-- together with the rest; section 5 has no 5.2 or 5.3.
`the provisions of section 5` MEANS LIST "5(a)", "5(b)"
`section 11 names provisions section 5 does not have` MEANS
    (NOT elem "5.2" `the provisions of section 5`) AND NOT elem "5.3" `the provisions of section 5`
#ASSERT `section 11 names provisions section 5 does not have`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_03-c: §8.1 computes on "the combined salary (under
-- section 3 above)"; section 3 is the definitions, the tables are section 4.
DECLARE `section of this circular` IS ONE OF
    `section 3 definitions`, `section 4 combined-salary tables`, `section 6 merger supplement`
`what section 8.1 cites for the combined salary` MEANS `section 3 definitions`
`section 8.1 cites the definitions for the combined salary` MEANS
    NOT (`what section 8.1 cites for the combined salary` EQUALS `section 4 combined-salary tables`)
#ASSERT `section 8.1 cites the definitions for the combined salary`

-- F-2017-18_tashach_03-d: the mentor stipend has no base for a principal.
`a principal mentor has no stipend base` MEANS
        isNothing (`the mentor stipend base` `a principal not in the reform` 10000 0 160 1900)
    AND isNothing (`the mentor stipend base` `a principal in the reform` 10000 2000 0 0)
#ASSERT `a principal mentor has no stipend base`

-- Examples. Salary figures are placeholders, not from any payslip.
`an employee outside the reform` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `category` IS `a teacher not in the reform`
`an employee in the reform` MEANS `employee` WITH
    `covered by the Oz LeTmura agreement of 14.8.2011` IS TRUE
    `category` IS `a teacher in the reform`

