#ASSERT `the one-time grant due` (LIST `grant month` 0.5 `worked`, `grant month` 1.2 `maternity and parenthood, reserve duty or unpaid sick leave`, `grant month` 1 `unpaid leave, sabbatical or leave treated as unpaid`) EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the 87 transition supplement under section 18b` FALSE (Date 1 10 2019) EQUALS JUST 1008.52
